// v5.6 (2026-07-08)
// -----------------
// Coach — sticky reads (fixes notes vanishing before they can be read)
//   - Range/blocker/sizing reads are hand-scoped intel, but the advice line
//     rebuilds on every action and could replace a note seconds after it
//     appeared. Reads now also land in a pinned 📌 line under the advice that
//     survives every rebuild (and your fold) until the hand ends. The pinned
